<% content_for :title, "NEET PG Choice Planner" %>
<% content_for :body_class, "landing" %>
<header class="lp-nav">
  <span class="lp-brand">NEET PG Choice Planner</span>
  <nav>
    <%= link_to "Extension", extension_path, data: click_event("landing/nav-extension") %>
    <%= link_to "AI assistants", connect_path, data: click_event("landing/nav-assistants") %>
    <%= link_to "https://github.com/fazzledev/neet-pg-choice-planner", target: "_blank", rel: "noopener", "aria-label": "Source on GitHub", data: click_event("landing/nav-github") do %><%= icon("github") %><% end %>
    <%= link_to "Open planner", planner_path, class: "button primary", data: click_event("landing/nav-open-planner") %>
  </nav>
</header>

<main class="lp">
  <section class="lp-hero">
    <span class="lp-kicker">NEET PG 2026 counselling</span>
    <p class="lp-greeting">Dear Doctors,</p>
    <h1>Plan your choices calmly.<br>Then fill them in minutes.</h1>
    <p class="lp-lede">Search all <%= number_with_delimiter(@choice_count) %> choices across <%= number_with_delimiter(@institute_count) %> institutes, shape your plan the way you think, and copy it to the counselling portal in one click.</p>
    <div class="lp-cta">
      <%= link_to planner_path, class: "button primary lp-big", data: click_event("landing/hero-start-planning") do %>Start planning<%= icon("arrow-right") %><% end %>
      <%= link_to extension_path, class: "button lp-big", data: click_event("landing/hero-extension") do %><%= icon("puzzle") %>Get the filler extension<% end %>
      <%= render "shared/share_menu", event_prefix: "landing", summary_class: "button lp-big", label: "Share with a friend", align: "from-left" %>
    </div>
    <p class="lp-note"><%= icon("shield-check") %>Free and open source. No account needed. Works offline.</p>
    <figure class="lp-demo">
      <div class="lp-shot-bar"><span></span><span></span><span></span><em>neet-pg-choice-planner.fazzle.dev/plan</em></div>
      <video class="lp-demo-video" src="<%= asset_path("planner-demo.mp4") %>" poster="<%= asset_path("planner-demo-poster.jpg") %>" muted loop playsinline controls preload="none" aria-label="Entering a rank, filtering to MD Radiodiagnosis in Karnataka and Maharashtra, seeing past closing ranks and chances, adding two seats, moving one up the plan and viewing the plan by institute"></video>
    </figure>
    <%= javascript_include_tag "landing", defer: true %>
    <%= javascript_include_tag "share", defer: true %>
    <%= javascript_include_tag "menus", defer: true %>
  </section>

  <section class="lp-section">
    <h2>Everything the portal makes hard</h2>
    <div class="lp-grid four">
      <article class="lp-card">
        <span class="lp-icon"><%= icon("search") %></span>
        <h3>Find seats fast</h3>
        <p>Search by college, city or speciality. Filter by course, state, institute type and quota, with as many picks per filter as you like.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="lp-card">
        <span class="lp-icon"><%= icon("layers") %></span>
        <h3>Group the way you think</h3>
        <p>See the catalog and your plan grouped by institute or by speciality, so you can compare options side by side.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="lp-card">
        <span class="lp-icon"><%= icon("grip-vertical") %></span>
        <h3>Drag to rank</h3>
        <p>Reorder by dragging or by typing a rank, gather a college's seats together, and keep a note on every choice.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="lp-card">
        <span class="lp-icon"><%= icon("wifi-off") %></span>
        <h3>Works offline</h3>
        <p>Your plan is saved in your browser as you go. A dropped connection or a portal outage costs you nothing.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="lp-card">
        <span class="lp-icon"><%= icon("cloud") %></span>
        <h3>Sync and undo</h3>
        <p>Sign in with an emailed link to use the same plan on phone and laptop, with a history you can restore from.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="lp-card">
        <span class="lp-icon"><%= icon("phone") %></span>
        <h3>Ask before you choose</h3>
        <p>For shortlisted DNB hospitals, the coordinator's contact sits next to the seat, so you can ask about stipend, bond and duty hours first.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="lp-card">
        <span class="lp-icon"><%= icon("trending-up") %></span>
        <h3>See past closing ranks</h3>
        <p>Most choices show how deep MCC allotted them in 2023–2025, round by round, for Open and your category.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="lp-card">
        <span class="lp-icon"><%= icon("target") %></span>
        <h3>Know your chances</h3>
        <p>Enter your rank to see each choice marked Likely, Possible, Borderline or Reach. A rough guide from past rounds, not a prediction.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="lp-section lp-split">
    <div>
      <span class="lp-kicker">Chrome extension</span>
      <h2>Copy your plan to the portal</h2>
<p>Plan in Choice Planner, then let the extension make the counselling portal match. It works in Chrome on a computer.</p>
      <ol class="lp-steps">
        <li>Open the planner in Chrome. Your plan syncs to the extension by itself.</li>
        <li>Sign in to the counselling portal yourself and open Choice Filling. The panel says <em>In sync</em> or how many choices differ.</li>
        <li>Press <strong>Plan → MCC</strong>. MCC becomes an exact copy of your plan: missing choices added, dropped ones removed, everything in your order of preference. Check it, then press Save and Continue and enter the OTP.</li>
      </ol>
      <p>Changed your list on the portal directly? <strong>MCC → Plan</strong> makes your plan a copy of MCC instead, and you can undo it.</p>
      <%= link_to extension_path, class: "button lp-big", data: click_event("landing/extension-install") do %><%= icon("puzzle") %>Install the extension<% end %>
    </div>
<figure class="lp-shot" aria-label="Screenshot of the extension panel on the MCC choice-filling page">
  <div class="lp-shot-bar"><span></span><span></span><span></span><em>mcc.admissions.nic.in/Applicant/Choice/ChoiceFilling.aspx</em></div>
  <div class="lp-shot-page" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="lp-shot-head"><b>Available Choice(s)</b><b>Filled Choice(s)</b></div>
    <% 7.times do %><div class="lp-shot-row"><i></i><i></i></div><% end %>
  </div>
  <div class="lp-panel">
      <strong>NEET PG Choice Planner</strong>
      <p class="lp-panel-sub">Your plan: 60 choices, synced just now.</p>
      <p class="lp-panel-state">3 differences</p>
      <div class="lp-panel-group missing">
        <h4>In your plan, not on MCC yet (2)</h4>
        <p><span>#14</span>Aster Medcity, Kochi · Orthopaedics · DNB Quota</p>
        <p><span>#15</span>Lisie Hospital, Kochi · Orthopaedics · DNB Quota</p>
      </div>
      <div class="lp-panel-group moved">
        <h4>On MCC at a different rank (1)</h4>
        <p><span>MCC #9</span>Govt. Medical College, Kozhikode · M.S. Orthopaedics</p>
      </div>
      <div class="lp-panel-actions"><span class="lp-panel-btn">Plan → MCC</span><span class="lp-panel-btn ghost">MCC → Plan</span></div>
      </div>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section class="lp-section lp-split lp-split-flip">
    <div>
      <span class="lp-kicker">ChatGPT and Claude</span>
      <h2>Shape your plan by asking</h2>
      <p>Connect the planner to ChatGPT or Claude and talk your list into shape. Your assistant searches every choice, reads DNB contacts, and adds, ranks or notes choices in your plan. Each change is saved to your plan, and History keeps earlier versions you can restore.</p>
      <ol class="lp-steps">
        <li>Add the planner as a connector in ChatGPT or Claude, using the link on the connect page.</li>
        <li>Sign in with your email and press <strong>Allow</strong>.</li>
        <li>Ask in your own words: “Move every DNB seat below my MD and MS choices.”</li>
      </ol>
      <p>It can't reach the counselling portal. Copying to MCC still goes through the extension, and locking stays with you.</p>
      <%= link_to connect_path, class: "button lp-big", data: click_event("landing/assistant-connect") do %><%= icon("sparkles") %>Connect your assistant<% end %>
    </div>
    <figure class="lp-shot lp-shot-chat" aria-label="Example of ChatGPT adding choices to a plan through the planner connector">
      <div class="lp-shot-bar"><span></span><span></span><span></span><em>chatgpt.com</em></div>
      <div class="lp-chat">
        <div class="lp-chat-side" aria-hidden="true"><% 6.times do %><i></i><% end %></div>
        <div class="lp-chat-main">
          <p class="lp-chat-you">Add MD Radiodiagnosis seats in Karnataka after my top five.</p>
          <p class="lp-chat-tool"><%= icon("search") %>NEET PG Choice Planner · Search choices</p>
          <p class="lp-chat-tool"><%= icon("list-ordered") %>NEET PG Choice Planner · Add to plan</p>
          <p class="lp-chat-ai">Done. I found 11 MD Radiodiagnosis seats in Karnataka and added them at #6 to #16, from Bangalore Medical College to Shimoga Institute of Medical Sciences. Want them ordered by city instead?</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section class="lp-section lp-trust">
    <h2>You stay in control</h2>
    <div class="lp-grid three">
      <article class="lp-card">
        <span class="lp-icon"><%= icon("shield-check") %></span>
        <h3>Never locks</h3>
        <p>The extension refuses anything that locks choices. Saving and locking stay with you.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="lp-card">
        <span class="lp-icon"><%= icon("eye") %></span>
        <h3>Never signs in for you</h3>
        <p>You type your portal password, pin and OTP. Choice Planner never sees them.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="lp-card">
        <span class="lp-icon"><%= icon("github") %></span>
        <h3>Open source</h3>
        <p>Every line is on GitHub under the MIT license, so anyone can check what it does.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="lp-final">
    <h2>Your plan, ready before the round opens</h2>
    <%= link_to planner_path, class: "button primary lp-big", data: click_event("landing/final-start-planning") do %>Start planning<%= icon("arrow-right") %><% end %>
  </section>
</main>

<footer class="lp-foot">
  <p>NEET PG Choice Planner is an independent tool and is not affiliated with the Medical Counselling Committee, NBEMS or the Government of India. Choice data comes from the lists the Medical Counselling Committee publishes. Past closing ranks are calculated by this tool from MCC's published allotment results (<%= link_to "sources", "https://github.com/fazzledev/neet-pg-choice-planner/blob/main/docs/mcc-allotment-sources.md", target: "_blank", rel: "noopener", data: click_event("landing/footer-rank-sources") %>) and are not official figures. Always confirm on the official portal before locking.</p>
  <p>Questions or feedback? Call <%= link_to contact_phone_display, contact_phone_url, data: click_event("landing/footer-call") %>, <%= link_to "message on WhatsApp", contact_whatsapp_url, target: "_blank", rel: "noopener", data: click_event("landing/footer-whatsapp") %> or email <%= mail_to contact_email, data: click_event("landing/footer-email") %>.</p>
  <p>Built with ❤️, 🧠 and 🤖 by <%= link_to "Syed Fazil Basheer", "https://fazzle.dev", target: "_blank", rel: "noopener", data: click_event("landing/footer-author") %> · <%= link_to "Source on GitHub", "https://github.com/fazzledev/neet-pg-choice-planner", target: "_blank", rel: "noopener", data: click_event("landing/footer-github") %> · <%= link_to "Docs on DeepWiki", "https://deepwiki.com/fazzledev/neet-pg-choice-planner", target: "_blank", rel: "noopener", data: click_event("landing/footer-deepwiki") %> · <%= link_to "Privacy", privacy_path, data: click_event("landing/footer-privacy") %> · MIT license</p>
</footer>
